  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Legendary low-top AF1 sneaker silhouette\nPremium leather upper\nCrushed velvet collar and sockliner offers additional relief\nFixed, studded floral embellishments on heel, lateral, and medial sides adds an elegant touch\nPatent leather Swooshes and heel detail for a luxe look\nFull-length Nike Air unit provides shock absorption and lasting comfort\nPerforated toebox enhances ventilation\nClassic lace closure secures the fit\nDurable rubber outsole with classic pivot circle pattern delivers reliable traction and a classic look\nThe Nike Air Force 1 '07 \"Florette\" is imported.\nLend some ladylike elegance to your footwear rotation with the Women's Nike Air Force 1 '07 \"Florette\" Casual Shoes. Crafted with a premium leather upper, this exclusive edition of the AF1 is feminine-forward, featuring heels and Swooshes with a glossy patent leather finish, crushed velvet sock liners, and studded floral embellishments throughout—for the sneakerhead with an affinity for flowers.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Air Force 1 '07 \"Florette\" Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Pink Rise/Pink Foam/Metallic Silver/Pink Rise</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 